  m_text: "<b>OPERATION NIGHTFALL // HAJIN DMZ (KOREAN PENINSULA)</b>\r\nClassification: <color=#E5A024>TIER-1 OFF-GRID BLACK OPS</color>\r\n\r\n<b>ACT I \u2014 CHECKPOINT NIGHT RAID (STAGE 1-2)</b>\r\nCapt. Price, Ghost, and Gaz infiltrate off-the-grid with ROK 707 liaison Pvt. Park Hyun-Jun to smash Konni's forward picket and breach Blast Gate Alpha.\r\n\r\n<b>ACT II \u2014 [CLASSIFIED: REACH ACT II IN CAMPAIGN]</b>\r\nClear Gate Alpha to decrypt Konni EW jamming logs inside Hajin City.\r\n\r\n<b>ACT III \u2014 [CLASSIFIED: REACH ACT III IN CAMPAIGN]</b>\r\nEliminate the Konni Depot BTR to unlock Extraction LZ Evac-6 dossier logs.\r\n"
